string.value:
Right, so the other day I was Nudling something and I accidentally clicked an ad
for hemorrhoid cream. Now I'm being bombarded with pop-ups for retirement homes,
meal supplements. Nudle seems to think I'm 100 years old or something.

Toys study your children, reporting their play habits back to marketers. [Silence 0.1]Appliances, consoles and home security systems give corporations a window into your
private life. [Silence 0.1]Control of your vehicle and mobile device can now be breached remotely by anyone,
at any time. [Silence 0.1]You may think that you are immune or underestimate the risks, [Silence 0.1]but your digital shadow is already compromised.
